                                    "taken_at": 1765545375,
                                    "caption": {
                                      "text": "This viral video captures a man repeatedly attempting to flee a pursuing Belgian Malinois through a kennel gate, creating a comedic \"infinity loop\" as the dog's relentless energy traps him in a cycle of evasion, filmed at what appears to be a dog training facility.\r\n, an account specialising in absurd, decontextualised human moments, the clip amassed over 8 million views and 34,000 likes within weeks, highlighting the breed's renowned stamina—Belgian Malinois can sustain high-intensity activity for up to 30 minutes without fatigue, per veterinary studies on working dogs.\r\nReplies blend humour with practical advice, such as closing the gate firmly or tiring the dog out, underscoring the video's appeal as light-hearted escapism amid everyday frustrations, while sparking discussions on canine behaviour and owner mishaps.",
